  "cues": [
   [
    0.1,
    "Chapter two, lesson three."
   ],
   [
    2.251,
    "Conjugated and derived proteins."
   ],
   [
    4.672,
    "Think of a plain loaf of bread."
   ],
   [
    6.573,
    "You can eat it as it is, or you can add something to it: butter, jam, a slice of cheese."
   ],
   [
    12.355,
    "The bread is the same, but now it carries a passenger."
   ],
   [
    15.766,
    "Here is our protein family tree."
   ],
   [
    17.784,
    "Last time we lit the simple proteins, the ones made of amino acids and nothing else."
   ],
   [
    22.876,
    "Today we light the other two branches: conjugated proteins, which carry a passenger, and derived proteins, which are what is left after a protein has been changed."
   ]
  ]
